{"title":"The Lego Game Boy","link":"https://kottke.org/25/08/the-lego-game-boy","date":1755025569000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lego-gameboy-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lego-gameboy-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lego-gameboy-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"868\" alt=\"a man holding the Lego Game Boy\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lego-gameboy-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lego-gameboy-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lego-gameboy-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1018\" alt=\"a Lego Game Boy\" /></p>\n\n<p>Lego is coming out with <a href=\"https://www.lego.com/en-us/product/game-boy-72046\">a near 1:1 replica</a> of Nintendo’s iconic Game Boy handheld video game system. It’s not playable, but you can insert &amp; remove Lego game cartridges and use different lenticular screens to pretend. Here’s <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z02XNXDrFNw\">a short video</a> showing how it “works”:</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p>You can <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/B0DX3J6MT7/ref=nosim/0sil8\">preorder the kit from Amazon</a>; the price is $60, which is only $30 less than the actual Game Boy cost when it was released.<sup><a href=\"#fn:1755010641\">1</a></sup></p>\n\n<p>I still have my original Game Boy from 1989 — it’s sitting on a table near where I’m typing this. I played so so much Tetris on that thing… (via <a href=\"https://mossandfog.com/legos-11-scale-gameboy-is-a-buildable-nostalgia-trip/\">moss &amp; fog</a>)</p>\n\n<ol><p><li>Although $90 in 1989 is $235 in 2025 dollars, which is right around what <a href=\"https://play.date/shop/\">the Playdate handheld</a> costs.<a href=\"#fnref:1755010641\">↩</a></li></p></ol>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Game%20Boy\">Game Boy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Lego\">Lego</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Nintendo\">Nintendo</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/remix\">remix</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/video%20games\">video games</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/08/the-lego-game-boy\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"cfa603d88a55f081003c4352380a6528b50e326aa5adb58401f034e9e2f0b3d7","category":"Sites"}